# Code owners — these paths require @laqieer review before merge.
# Rationale (SECURITY.md): the `make compare` byte oracle vets the ROM, but NOT code that runs at
# BUILD or CI time. Changes to the build system, tooling, and CI can execute arbitrary code even
# while `make compare` stays green, so they get mandatory human review.

# Build system & CI (highest risk — runs code in CI)
/Makefile                @laqieer
/.github/                @laqieer
/scripts/                @laqieer
/tools/                  @laqieer
/graphics/**/*.mk        @laqieer

# Layout / manifest glue (drives what gets linked and where)
/layout/                 @laqieer

# Project governance
/SECURITY.md             @laqieer
/CONTRIBUTING.md         @laqieer
/CODEOWNERS              @laqieer
/.github/CODEOWNERS      @laqieer
